From: HbbTV2 experiment <noreply@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] GStreamer: add Dreambox quirk and hole-punch quirk (dvbvideosink/dvbaudiosink)

Dreambox (Broadcom) boxes decode with gst-plugin-dvbmediasink: dvbvideosink drives the hardware video plane, which
sits underneath the OSD. Add a quirk (WEBKIT_GST_QUIRKS=dreambox: dvbaudiosink, native audio/video playbin flags)
and a hole-punch quirk (WEBKIT_GST_HOLE_PUNCH_QUIRK=dreambox: dvbvideosink; the video element's rectangle is mapped
to /proc/stb/vmpeg/0/dst_* in the driver's 720x576 output space).

---
